      "speakerEn": "Launch Commentator",
      "startSec": 0.88,
      "textEn": "Engine ignition. Liftoff of the Falcon 9 rocket. With science for today and for deep space exploration tomorrow. Falcon 9 has cleared the towers.",
      "textZh": "发动机点火。Falcon 9 火箭升空。承载着服务于当今以及未来深空探索的科学任务。Falcon 9 已越过发射塔。",
      "speakerZh": "发射解说员"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-0002",
      "speakerEn": "Mission Control",
      "startSec": 28.88,
      "textEn": "Impact chill has begun.",
      "textZh": "冲击冷却已经开始。",
      "speakerZh": "任务控制中心"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-0003",
      "speakerEn": "Mission Control",
      "startSec": 36.94,
      "textEn": "Landing legs have deployed.",
      "textZh": "着陆腿已展开。",
      "speakerZh": "任务控制中心"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-0004",
      "speakerEn": "Mission Control",
      "startSec": 48.38,
      "textEn": "Of course. I still love you. We have a Falcon 9 on board.",
      "textZh": "“当然我依然爱你”号。我们船上有一枚 Falcon 9。",
      "speakerZh": "任务控制中心"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-0005",
      "speakerEn": "Mission Control",
      "startSec": 61.59,
      "textEn": "Landing operators Moving to procedure 11.100 on recovery net.",
      "textZh": "着陆操作人员，在回收通信网转入程序 11.100。",
      "speakerZh": "任务控制中心"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-0006",
      "speakerEn": "Launch Commentator",
      "startSec": 74.31,
      "textEn": "Waiting for the engine.",
